<div  data-lazy-bg class='ep-columns ep-space-mini avia-full-stretch align-top ep-lazy-loaded   ep-break-at-tablet ep-columns-3 ' style='background-repeat: no-repeat;background-attachment: scroll;background-position: center center;--epBGImg:url(https://censys.com/wp-content/uploads/case-study-photo-07.png); --epColumnSpace:225px; '  ><div class='ep-columns-inner' ><div  class="ep-column one-half   ep-lazy-loaded first  avia-builder-el-21  avia-builder-el-first   " ><div class="ep-column-inner" ><div><div   class='av-special-heading av-special-heading-h2 ep-text    avia-builder-el-22  avia-builder-el-first   ep-space-small    ' ><div class='av-subheading av-subheading_above  ' ><p>Case Study</p>
</div><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '   >The Citizen Lab</h2><div class='special-heading-border'><div class='special-heading-inner-border' ></div></div></div>
<div class="avia_textblock ep-text   avia-builder-el-23   ep-space-top-small ep-space-bottom-none     "  ><h5>Highlights</h5>
<ul>
<li>Mapped Candiru&#8217;s global command and control infrastructure</li>
<li>Identified self-signed certificates associated with the spyware vendor</li>
<li>Uncovered over 750 websites impersonated by the attacker</li>
<li>Located victims and recovered critical spyware samples for analysis</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div  class='avia-button-wrap avia-button-left ep-space-top-mini ep-space-bottom-small    avia-builder-el-24  avia-builder-el-last  '  ><a href='https://censys.com/case-studies/citizen-lab-uses-censys-data-exposing-mercenary-spwyware-candiru/'  class='avia-button   avia-icon_select-no avia-style-outline-yellow avia-color-default avia-size-large avia-position-left'  target="_blank"   ><span class='avia_iconbox_title' >Read More</span></a></div></div></div></div><div  class="ep-column one-half   ep-lazy-loaded   avia-builder-el-25  avia-builder-el-last  testimonial--column  " ><div class="ep-column-inner" ><div><div  class='ep-item-grid-wrapper ep-grid-wrapper   ep-space-small  avia-builder-el-26  avia-builder-el-no-sibling  itemgrid--testimonials-case-study ' style='--itemCount: 1;' >
